{"version": 2, "width": 90, "height": 26, "timestamp": 1757600000, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.500000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n"]
[0.800000, "o", "  AETHERIUS ORACLE — Settlement Window Defense Demo\r\n"]
[1.200000, "o", "  The blind spot in x402 agent commerce.\r\n"]
[1.500000, "o", "========================================================================\r\n\r\n"]
[2.500000, "o", "[SCENE 1] THE ATTACK\r\n"]
[2.800000, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[3.200000, "o", "A bot swarm floods an x402 API with 10 requests/second.\r\n"]
[3.800000, "o", "Each request carries a payment proof. The API processes them.\r\n"]
[4.500000, "o", "But between proof submission and L2 finality (1-2s on Base)...\r\n"]
[5.200000, "o", "...the same proof can be reused. Free data. No settlement.\r\n"]
[6.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.500000, "o", "Bot wallet: 0xDEAD...BEEF\r\n"]
[7.000000, "o", "Target: /v1/email/validate ($0.005/call)\r\n"]
[7.500000, "o", "Strategy: flood with same proof before L2 confirms\r\n"]
[8.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[8.500000, "o", "Request  1 → 200 OK   (proof accepted, settlement deferred)\r\n"]
[9.000000, "o", "Request  2 → 200 OK   (same proof, not yet confirmed on-chain)\r\n"]
[9.500000, "o", "Request  3 → 200 OK   (still in the optimism window)\r\n"]
[10.000000, "o", "Request  4 → 200 OK  (bot collecting free data)\r\n"]
[10.500000, "o", "Request  5 → 200 OK  (velocity: 5.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[11.000000, "o", "Request  6 → 200 OK  (velocity: 6.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[11.500000, "o", "Request  7 → 200 OK  (velocity: 7.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[12.000000, "o", "Request  8 → 200 OK  (velocity: 8.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[12.500000, "o", "Request  9 → 200 OK  (velocity: 9.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[13.000000, "o", "Request 10 → 200 OK  (velocity: 10.0 req/s)\r\n"]
[13.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.000000, "o", "10 requests. 10 payments. But settlement hasn't confirmed.\r\n"]
[14.500000, "o", "If the bot stops here, all 10 proofs fail on-chain.\r\n"]
[15.000000, "o", "The API served $0.05 of data. Received $0.00.\r\n"]
[15.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.000000, "o", "[SCENE 2] THE ORACLE DETECTS\r\n"]
[16.500000, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[17.000000, "o", "AETHERIUS Credit Velocity tracks per-agent nonce submission rates.\r\n"]
[17.500000, "o", "The moment velocity exceeds threshold, the oracle acts.\r\n"]
[18.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.500000, "o", "$ curl /v1/oracle/risk/0xDEAD...BEEF\r\n"]
[19.500000, "o", "{\r\n"]
[20.000000, "o", "  \"address\": \"0xDEAD...BEEF\",\r\n"]
[20.500000, "o", "  \"risk_score\": 72.5,\r\n"]
[21.000000, "o", "  \"risk_level\": \"danger\",\r\n"]
[21.500000, "o", "  \"velocity\": 8.3,\r\n"]
[22.000000, "o", "  \"settlement_rate\": 0.0,\r\n"]
[22.500000, "o", "  \"total_requests\": 10,\r\n"]
[23.000000, "o", "  \"total_settled\": 0,\r\n"]
[23.500000, "o", "  \"blocked\": true,\r\n"]
[24.000000, "o", "  \"block_remaining_s\": 12.0,\r\n"]
[24.500000, "o", "  \"recommendation\": \"reject\"\r\n"]
[25.000000, "o", "}\r\n"]
[25.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[26.000000, "o", "Settlement rate: 0.0 — zero confirmations on-chain.\r\n"]
[26.500000, "o", "The oracle flagged this agent as fraudulent.\r\n"]
[27.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[27.500000, "o", "[SCENE 3] THE BLOCK\r\n"]
[28.000000, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[28.500000, "o", "Request 11 → 429 Rate Limited\r\n"]
[29.000000, "o", "{\r\n"]
[29.500000, "o", "  \"error\": \"Rate limited: settlement velocity exceeded\",\r\n"]
[30.000000, "o", "  \"risk_score\": 72.5,\r\n"]
[30.500000, "o", "  \"risk_level\": \"danger\",\r\n"]
[31.000000, "o", "  \"velocity\": 8.3,\r\n"]
[31.500000, "o", "  \"settlement_rate\": 0.0,\r\n"]
[32.000000, "o", "  \"block_remaining_s\": 12.0,\r\n"]
[32.500000, "o", "  \"hint\": \"Wait for pending settlements to confirm.\"\r\n"]
[33.000000, "o", "}\r\n"]
[33.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[34.000000, "o", "Request 12 → 429 Rate Limited\r\n"]
[34.500000, "o", "Request 13 → 429 Rate Limited\r\n"]
[35.000000, "o", "Request 14 → 429 Rate Limited\r\n"]
[35.500000, "o", "Request 15 → 429 Rate Limited\r\n"]
[36.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[36.500000, "o", "5 more attempts. All blocked. Zero data served.\r\n"]
[37.000000, "o", "The bot's attack window: 10 seconds.\r\n"]
[37.500000, "o", "The oracle's response time: < 100ms.\r\n"]
[38.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[38.500000, "o", "[SCENE 4] THE DEFENSE IS LIVE\r\n"]
[39.000000, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[39.500000, "o", "This isn't a simulation. This is production code.\r\n"]
[40.000000, "o", "Every endpoint on AETHERIUS runs credit velocity scoring.\r\n"]
[40.500000, "o", "Every agent is tracked. Every settlement is verified.\r\n"]
[41.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[41.500000, "o", "Attackers see: 429 + risk_score + block timer.\r\n"]
[42.000000, "o", "Honest agents see: 200 + data + settlement confirmation.\r\n"]
[42.500000, "o", "API providers see: reputation scores factored by agent trust.\r\n"]
[43.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.500000, "o", "[SCENE 5] WHAT THIS MEANS\r\n"]
[44.000000, "o", "------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[44.500000, "o", "x402 enables M2M commerce. But without trust, it's chaos.\r\n"]
[45.000000, "o", "AETHERIUS is the trust layer.\r\n"]
[45.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[46.000000, "o", "For agents:    discover verified endpoints, pay per call.\r\n"]
[46.500000, "o", "For providers: query agent risk BEFORE accepting payment.\r\n"]
[47.000000, "o", "For the network: reputation that compounds with usage.\r\n"]
[47.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
[48.000000, "o", "APIs agents can trust. Payments providers can verify.\r\n"]
[48.500000, "o", "The oracle layer for x402 commerce on Base.\r\n"]
[49.000000, "o", "\r\n"]
[49.500000, "o", "  github.com/wilnowilx/aetheriusxapi\r\n"]
[50.000000, "o", "  /v1/oracle/risk/{address}  — live now\r\n"]
[50.500000, "o", "\r\n"]
